        "title": "Moving experience ",
        "text": "This is a favourite place of mine when I visit \nKathmandu. World heritage site\nVisit in the daytime so that you can have a good look around, if possible return in the evening. \nAt 6 pm every night a prayer ceremony called \n‘Arti’ takes place, it is a moving experience and I wouldn’t miss it, take a guide to explain things to you\nCremations take place along the river of this temple, some people may be disturbed by this\nBut it’s part of their culture, just be respectful and don’t let this put you off ",
